{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":29.989999771118164,"text":"Look carefully at the rock in its tank. Very often you will see nothing at all, because an octopus can change the color and the texture of its skin in under a second and become stone. It has nine brains, one central, and one in each arm, so its arms solve problems almost by themselves. Its blood is blue, because it carries oxygen using copper instead of iron. It is the most alien creature you can meet without leaving the Mediterranean.","words":[{"word":"Look","start":0,"end":0.5},{"word":"carefully","start":0.5,"end":1},{"word":"at","start":1,"end":1.2999999523162842},{"word":"the","start":1.2999999523162842,"end":1.5},{"word":"rock","start":1.5,"end":1.7400000095367432},{"word":"in","start":1.7400000095367432,"end":1.9199999570846558},{"word":"its","start":1.9199999570846558,"end":2.0999999046325684},{"word":"tank","start":2.0999999046325684,"end":2.4000000953674316},{"word":"Very","start":3.140000104904175,"end":3.3399999141693115},{"word":"often","start":3.3399999141693115,"end":3.619999885559082},{"word":"you","start":3.619999885559082,"end":3.8399999141693115},{"word":"will","start":3.8399999141693115,"end":4.059999942779541},{"word":"see","start":4.059999942779541,"end":4.300000190734863},{"word":"nothing","start":4.300000190734863,"end":4.519999980926514},{"word":"at","start":4.519999980926514,"end":5.340000152587891},{"word":"all","start":5.340000152587891,"end":5.340000152587891},{"word":"because","start":5.460000038146973,"end":5.639999866485596},{"word":"an","start":5.639999866485596,"end":6.019999980926514},{"word":"octopus","start":6.019999980926514,"end":6.199999809265137},{"word":"can","start":6.199999809265137,"end":6.679999828338623},{"word":"change","start":6.679999828338623,"end":6.980000019073486},{"word":"the","start":6.980000019073486,"end":7.360000133514404},{"word":"color","start":7.360000133514404,"end":7.559999942779541},{"word":"and","start":7.559999942779541,